+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on the password hashing algorithm: no policy document, code, configuration, or commit in this repository specifies one, and the only mentions found were unconfirmed, low-trust session transcripts (not corroborated by a commit or exit code and not stated by the user in the current session), which a memory check explicitly flagged as insufficient to treat as an established decision. Until a decision is recorded through an authoritative source (e.g., a merged change, configuration, or explicit statement in this session), no algorithm should be assumed or implemented based on those transcripts.
